(text "External relay contacts switch supplied fused +12 V to each matched wideband controller.\nController ground remains connected; 0-5 V outputs feed WB1_0_5V / WB2_0_5V.\nUse coil suppression (diode cathode to coil +12 V, anode to the low-side return) and ON/OFF firmware control.\nThe wideband controller, not this relay stage, regulates the LSU heater." (at 15 244 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6ebd369c-6acd-5335-9622-fcd8b09001a5))
